{"page":288,"verses":[{"verse_key":"17:59","surah":17,"ayah":59,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا مَنَعَنَآ أَن نُّرْسِلَ بِٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ إِلَّآ أَن كَذَّبَ بِهَا ٱلْأَوَّلُونَ ۚ وَءَاتَيْنَا ثَمُودَ ٱلنَّاقَةَ مُبْصِرَةً فَظَلَمُوا۟ بِهَا ۚ وَمَا نُرْسِلُ بِٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ إِلَّا تَخْوِيفًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Nothing prevents Us from sending miraculous signs, except the fact that previous peoples denied them. We gave the people of Thamud the she-camel as a clear sign, yet they maltreated it. We send signs only to give warning.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"17:59"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَنَعَنَآ","en_gloss":"stopped Us","transliteration":"manaʿanā","verse_key":"17:59"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"17:59"},{"pos":4,"ar":"نُّرْسِلَ","en_gloss":"We send","transliteration":"nur'sila","verse_key":"17:59"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"the Signs","transliteration":"bil-āyāti","verse_key":"17:59"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَّآ","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"17:59"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"17:59"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كَذَّبَ","en_gloss":"denied","transliteration":"kadhaba","verse_key":"17:59"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِهَا","en_gloss":"them","transliteration":"bihā","verse_key":"17:59"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْأَوَّلُونَ ۚ","en_gloss":"the former (people)","transliteration":"l-awalūna","verse_key":"17:59"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَءَاتَيْنَا","en_gloss":"And We gave","transliteration":"waātaynā","verse_key":"17:59"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ثَمُودَ","en_gloss":"Thamud","transliteration":"thamūda","verse_key":"17:59"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلنَّاقَةَ","en_gloss":"the she-camel","transliteration":"l-nāqata","verse_key":"17:59"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مُبْصِرَةًۭ","en_gloss":"(as) a visible sign","transliteration":"mub'ṣiratan","verse_key":"17:59"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَظَلَمُوا۟","en_gloss":"but they wronged","transliteration":"faẓalamū","verse_ke