id":85,"en":"When We said to the angels, ‘Bow down before Adam,’ they all bowed down, but not Iblis. He retorted, ‘Why should I bow down to someone You have created out of clay?’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذْ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idh","verse_key":"17:61"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قُلْنَا","en_gloss":"We said","transliteration":"qul'nā","verse_key":"17:61"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةِ","en_gloss":"to the Angels","transliteration":"lil'malāikati","verse_key":"17:61"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱسْجُدُوا۟","en_gloss":"Prostrate","transliteration":"us'judū","verse_key":"17:61"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لِـَٔادَمَ","en_gloss":"to Adam","transliteration":"liādama","verse_key":"17:61"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَسَجَدُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"So they prostrated","transliteration":"fasajadū","verse_key":"17:61"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَّآ","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"17:61"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِبْلِيسَ","en_gloss":"Iblis","transliteration":"ib'līsa","verse_key":"17:61"},{"pos":9,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"17:61"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ءَأَسْجُدُ","en_gloss":"Shall I prostrate","transliteration":"a-asjudu","verse_key":"17:61"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لِمَنْ","en_gloss":"to (one) whom","transliteration":"liman","verse_key":"17:61"},{"pos":12,"ar":"خَلَقْتَ","en_gloss":"You created","transliteration":"khalaqta","verse_key":"17:61"},{"pos":13,"ar":"طِينًۭا","en_gloss":"(from) clay","transliteration":"ṭīnan","verse_key":"17:61"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٦١","en_gloss":"(61)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:61"}]},{"verse_key":"17:62","surah":17,"ayah":62,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ أَرَءَيْتَكَ هَـٰذَا ٱلَّذِى كَرَّمْتَ عَلَىَّ لَئِنْ أَخَّرْتَنِ إِلَىٰ يَوْمِ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ لَأَحْتَنِكَنَّ ذُرِّيَّتَهُۥٓ إِلَّا قَلِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and [then] said, ‘You see this being You have honoured above me? If You reprieve me until the Day of Resurrection, I will lead all but a few of his descendants by the nose.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en